    },
    {
      "displayText": "大姐姐我呀，\n又～想让你帮忙调制香水了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592759D059D062115440FF0C000A53C8FF5E60F38BA94F605E2E5FD98C03523699996C344E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我感兴趣的是\n好啦鱿黑漆漆的墨汁！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211611F51748DA37684662F000A597D55669C7F9ED16F066F06768458A86C41FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以就又～想\n拜托你帮个忙了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55C3153C8FF5E60F3000A62DC62584F605E2E4E2A5FD94E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你愿意，\n就带着好啦鱿来找我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F60613F610FFF0C000A5C315E267740597D55669C7F6765627E62115427FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请把好啦鱿\n加入同行宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7628A597D55669C7F000A52A05165540C884C5B9D53EF68A6FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你帮我把\n好啦鱿带过来了呀！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n真是太感谢你了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E2E6211628A000A597D55669C7F5E268FC767654E865440FF0100100001BE00000A771F662F592A611F8C224F604E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，我来取\n一丢丢好啦鱿的墨汁！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C6211676553D6000A4E004E224E22597D55669C7F768458A86C41FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇！\n比我想象的还要黑。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C7FF01000A6BD4621160F38C6176848FD889819ED1300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总之我得去调制香水了！\n那就再见啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B4E4B62115F9753BB8C03523699996C344E86FF01000A90A35C31518D89C15566FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啦鱿的香水调好了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D55669C7F768499996C348C03597D4E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仿佛海风吹过般的\n清爽香气，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n真是芬芳迷人！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EFF4F5B6D7798CE54398FC7822C7684000A6E05723D99996C14FF0C00100001BE00000A771F662F82AC82B38FF74EBAFF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是有个问题……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F67094E2A95EE98982026202600100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这香味太刺激食欲了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD999995473592A523A6FC098DF6B324E86300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "或许有些人能发挥它的作用，\n但我很难把这款香水作为商品来销售。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62168BB867094E9B4EBA80FD53D163255B8376844F5C7528FF0C000A4F4662115F8896BE628A8FD96B3E99996C344F5C4E3A554654C167659500552E300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，反正调制出了厉害的香水……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C53CD6B638C03523651FA4E8653895BB3768499996C342026202600100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以这样就“好啦哟”！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58FD968375C31201C597D556654DF201DFF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
